 CellLabel->"Out[94]=",ExpressionUUID->"924ac4d6-9834-4775-bf97-844d968269ab"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Now we create a rule so that every time we find a second derivative of the \
function ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"RR", "[", "r", "]"}]], "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->
  "91473d11-62fc-49a0-b499-963938f84d2e"],
 " (which should be thought of as the solution to the Teukolsky radial ODE), \
we substitute it by its value according to the radial ODE:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.971354099758511*^9, 3.971354311247471*^9}, {
  3.971704707818344*^9, 3.971704708311502*^9}, {3.97170474666401*^9, 
  3.971704747069824*^9}, {3.971862254669382*^9, 
  3.971862256406765*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c72782d2-f893-4128-9264-\
c35c4f228f9b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"RadTeukRule", "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"RR", "''"}], "[", "r", "]"}], "->", 
    RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", 
        RowBox[{"RadTeuk", "[", 
         RowBox[{"RR", "[", "r", "]"}], "]"}]}], "/", 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", "[", "r", "]"}]}], "/.", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"RR", "''"}], "[", "r", "]"}], "->", "0"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Code",
 CellLabel->"In[95]:=",ExpressionUUID->"67cf1465-6020-476d-8678-fa46422a2068"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "With this rule at hand, we are ready to define a function that computes the \
radial Teukolsky-Starobinsky identity and thus should return a constant*the \
radial solution. This function takes as argument the spin value for which we \
want to compute the Teukolsky-Starobinsky constant. The spin here can have \
either sign, and indeed the Teukolsky-Starobinsky identity one needs to \
compute will change with the spin sign (the sequence of operators changes). \
It is a nice safety check that we obtain the same value for the constant for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
 "s"], "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"f233f617-3af7-4ade-a90d-7b9895e1ab9f"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"-", "s"}]], "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->
  "a0437fdc-130b-4796-aa1d-9f6606cc24b5"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.971354316479826*^9, 3.971354346299011*^9}, {
